  "answer": "The data obtained did not allow for the creation of a proper and practical algorithm to predict stone chemical composition based on hair and urine analysis.",
  "evidence": [
    "Only a few correlations between the composition of stones and the distribution of elements in urine and in hair were found. All were considered incidental."
